{"title":"1977 IMO Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Remarks_(added_by_pf02,_March_2026)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Remarks (added by pf02, March 2026)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/1/361f0c874212fed8be67cc782e4520b92ea12d87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,A,B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"69\" height=\"16\" /> be given reals. We consider the function defined by<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/2/792a9f8a71c29da6bd80b3305bc44e6b8ce0bdca.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x) = 1 - a \\cdot \\cos(x) - b \\cdot \\sin(x) - A \\cdot \\cos(2x) - B \\cdot \\sin(2x).\\]\" width=\"468\" height=\"18\" />Prove that if for any real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/3/12316c92a0c36c915d79988dc32c40578d1c0ce4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffba0b1a6e6d4b19503515f57ae34dd0aa6e0ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 + b^2 \\leq 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"90\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/9/c29d2c310b925fb291a303402562e4b65593a00b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A^2 + B^2 \\leq 1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"102\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/f/dff0dc94dd90caa59f6dbfdf4e051ef27cbeb55c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = 1-\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}\\sin (x+\\arctan\\frac{a}{b}) - \\sqrt{A^2+B^2}\\sin (2x+\\arctan\\frac{A}{B}) \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"589\" height=\"38\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/a/8bad9408d5707d6d1f8b61cebc824116c8f04ca7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x+\\pi) = 1+\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}\\sin (x+\\arctan\\frac{a}{b}) - \\sqrt{A^2+B^2}\\sin (2x+\\arctan\\frac{A}{B}) \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"622\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/e/4de163fd57ac8bb00f6100ddf95d4b7d880d3c00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{A^2+B^2}\\sin (2x+\\arctan\\frac{A}{B}) \\leq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"266\" height=\"38\" />. Since this identity is true for any real <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, let the sine term be one, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/8/d183c6520dfa78ee988fd12ce3dbe66000eedccf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\longrightarrow A^2+B^2 \\leq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"132\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>To get cancellation on the rightmost terms, note <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/0/ab042dee008278ba71f8fdfadf89d911f2dea91a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin (x+\\pi/2) = \\cos x, \\sin (x-\\pi/2) = -\\cos x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"348\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/2/4228b5befa53bed9b4f1cced0ecbfe339646bf7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x+\\pi/4) = 1-\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}\\sin (x+\\pi/4+\\arctan\\frac{a}{b}) - \\sqrt{A^2+B^2}\\cos2x+\\arctan\\frac{A}{B}) \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"690\" height=\"38\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/f/02f301a7c3b859797321631c02494b6b34e25a13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x-\\pi/4) = 1-\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}\\sin (x-\\pi/4+\\arctan\\frac{a}{b}) + \\sqrt{A^2+B^2}\\cos2x+\\arctan\\frac{A}{B}) \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"690\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/e/85ed3beb6c015a0299de9a27404beadd04acef42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+\\arctan\\frac{a}{b} = y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"133\" height=\"33\" />.\nThen <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/1/331dd45663abab1d3f97edc3d3a065eb03ee2064.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}(\\sin (y+\\pi/4) + \\sin (y-\\pi/4)) \\leq 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"333\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/8/2380ddd41be2d4b784a1bc532c6678c9a35f13f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{a^2+b^2} \\leq \\dfrac{2}{\\sqrt{2}(\\sin y)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"169\" height=\"43\" />.\n</p><p>Since it's valid for all real <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55cb49e83606581d23fe8c3678140a127187bfe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin y = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"67\" height=\"15\" />, and we are done.\n</p><p>The above solution was posted and copyrighted by aznlord1337.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Remarks_.28added_by_pf02.2C_March_2026.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Remarks_(added_by_pf02,_March_2026)\">Remarks (added by pf02, March 2026)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Remarks (added by pf02, March 2026)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If we want to be rigorous, the proof above is incorrect. The problem is that it uses\nthe formula\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/d/21db4ac32f2da8d3e4ecc14dbc76565f172068d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\cos x + b \\sin x = \\sqrt{a^2 + b^2} \\sin (x + \\arctan \\frac{a}{b})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"354\" height=\"34\" />\n</p><p>This should be\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/7/0c767a04875ae741656de5fb57cced1f9aa11f44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\cos x + b \\sin x = \\mathbf{sgn}(b) \\sqrt{a^2 + b^2} \\sin (x + \\arctan \\frac{a}{b})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"407\" height=\"34\" />\n</p><p>and it is valid when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/b/c5bc74cff8e915c20a122acb60a9cc29ac9cddc2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\ne 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"40\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>However, the idea of the proof is good, and it is not difficult to make it rigorous.\n</p><p><br />\nThe original thread for this problem can be found here: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://aops.com/community/p1351208\">[1]</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_IMO\" title=\"1977 IMO\">1977 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_IMO_Problems\" title=\"1977 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1977 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1977 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1977 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1977 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1977 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1977 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1977 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017053559\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 139/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 895/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4736/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.678      1 Template:IMO_box\n100.00%    6.678      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:20523:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017053559 and revision id 279972. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}